# API service environment variables (local dev).
# Copy to .env.local and fill in. Do not commit real secrets.

# Throttler shared store (multi-replica correctness).
# When set, @nestjs/throttler backs all rate-limit counters (including the
# 5/min limit on POST /api/founder-node/pair) with this Redis instance so every
# replica shares one counter. When unset, falls back to in-memory (fine for
# local dev, NOT safe for multi-replica deploys). Use an Upstash Redis URL
# (redis://...) on Railway. See apps/api/src/app.module.ts.
REDIS_URL=""